# t_eccd49eb mutation evidence

Every converted test in `MattermostTests/SocketClientTests.swift` has a product defect that
makes it fail, applied to the pristine tree in this worktree: product edit -> class run ->
`git checkout` of the edited files. `must red` is from the harness's own table
(`build/mutants/run_mutants.py`); `PASS` means every named target appears in the failures,
`MISSING` names a target that stayed green (that is a finding about the test, not the mutant).

